            "label": "Codex Leningradensis (B19A)",
            "text": "וְהָאָדָם יָדַע אֶת־חַוָּה אִשְׁתּוֹ וַתַּהַר וַתֵּלֶד אֶת־קַיִן",
            "transliteration": "Vehaadam yada et-havah ishto vatahar vateled et-qayin",
            "literalPt": "O homem conheceu Eva, sua mulher, e ela gerou Caim."
        }
    ],
    "greekWitnesses": [
        {
